
==========================================================================
  exp_i on branch-swaps of T = Q + (Q + Q)
==========================================================================

T has 3 leaf summands of width 1 -> width(T) = 2 tag + 1 payload = 3 qubits.

==========================================================================
  Part 1: swap_12 and swap_23 (raw involutions)
==========================================================================

swap_12 = assoc_r ; (twist+id) ; assoc_l:
3 qubits, 3 gates
  X q[0]
  CX q[0, 1]
  X q[0]
  perm: [0, 1, 2]
  circuit_size = 3

swap_23 = id + twist (omap0):
3 qubits, 3 gates
  Unitary2qBox q[0, 1]
  CX q[0, 1]
  Unitary2qBox q[0, 1]
  perm: [0, 1, 2]
  circuit_size = 3

==========================================================================
  Part 2: E12(pi/4) and E23(pi/4)
==========================================================================

E12(pi/4) = exp_i(pi/4, swap_12):
3 qubits, 1 gates
  Unitary3qBox q[0, 1, 2]
  perm: [0, 1, 2]
  circuit_size = 1

E23(pi/4) = exp_i(pi/4, swap_23):
3 qubits, 1 gates
  Unitary3qBox q[0, 1, 2]
  perm: [0, 1, 2]
  circuit_size = 1

==========================================================================
  Part 3: Composition law  E(pi/4);E(pi/4) = E(pi/2)
==========================================================================

E12(pi/2) [direct]:
3 qubits, 1 gates
  Unitary3qBox q[0, 1, 2]
  perm: [0, 1, 2]
  circuit_size = 1

E23(pi/2) [direct]:
3 qubits, 1 gates
  Unitary3qBox q[0, 1, 2]
  perm: [0, 1, 2]
  circuit_size = 1

E12(pi/4);E12(pi/4)  =  E12(pi/2):
  EQUAL (fidelity=1.000000)

E23(pi/4);E23(pi/4)  =  E23(pi/2):
  EQUAL (fidelity=1.000000)

==========================================================================
  Part 4: E12 and E23 do NOT commute
==========================================================================
  (swap_12 and swap_23 generate S_3; their exponentials
   inherit the non-abelian structure.)

E12(pi/4);E23(pi/4)  =/=  E23(pi/4);E12(pi/4):
  NOT EQUAL as expected (fidelity=0.812500)

